Easy to Draw Bed was added in '''Beta 51.0'''. It was a 5G 4/5 monster that would replace itself with a new monster after it attacked, setting the new monster's base stats to 4/4 and giving it Haste. '''Beta 52.0''' gave the new monster +1 base HP but no longer giving it Haste.

''This change was counted as a buff because it can still transform into a Haste or Charge monster, which allowed the new monster to basically perform a second attack. A Charge monster can also attack the opponent directly rather than being able to only attack a monster.''

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP: 5

Cost: 5

Abilities:
*After attacking, transform into a random monster.
**Set it to base 4/4 and give it Haste. (Post Beta 51.0)
**Set it to base 4/5. (Post Beta 52.0, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)
